# A library is built in place when the compiler is run on its `chemical.mod`
# (e.g. `TCCCompiler lang/libs/webserve/chemical.mod -o ...`, or a library test
# that links it). That writes a `build/` tree of generated C, object files and
# cache timestamps next to the sources, plus an artifact descriptor next to the
# output executable. None of it belongs in a commit: 43 such files (14 MB,
# including a 5.7 MB `object_tcc.o`) once reached `lang/libs/webserve/build/`.
lang/libs/*/build/
lang/libs/*/*.def

